{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Egnima</i> is a solo puzzle game where the player takes control of two interdependent cubes. Each must be used strategically to progress and solve ingenious puzzles. The adventure unfolds in a semi-open world, blending exploration with linear progression, where every challenge demands deep thinking and precise coordination between the two cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will take you through a variety of biomes, each introducing unique mechanics and brand-new challenges. You'll have to face blinding snowstorms, slippery ice surfaces that limit your control, and many other obstacles that will put your problem-solving and adaptability to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to master these hostile environments and overcome every puzzle to uncover all the secrets of <i>Enigma</i>?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the region.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/747f3b93704a4c5091e25083db2aeed28d766762.jpg"},{"name":"The beginning of a great adventure.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/3611f2f3b439ace35028f9ee3783b7c01fefef30.jpg"},{"name":"A packed city","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/bf7895fceb5e7b139a392b374a7568457e54089f.jpg"},{"name":"Lost in the forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/3fbd42c2b02f70f7fd8603a5d66505ee2164d4c3.jpg"},{"name":"Mother Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/a0a8156f882d06c677e7e29c33f5e80ef065f273.jpg"},{"name":"A flourishing neighborhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536770/c7299f1abf916e50b0623c2962cde715acebc934.jpg"},{"name":"The great story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3536